{"articleNo":"59737","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=59737&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 2학기 수강지도상담 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.07.25","hit":"12582","attachments":[{"name":"2012학년도 2학기 교육과정이수 원칙.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=59737&attachNo=1385"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012학년도 2학기 수강지도상담 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 2012학년도 2학기 “수강지도상담”을 아래와 같이 안내하오니, 해당 학생들 은 수강지도기간에 지도교수와 상담하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">“</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">수강승인”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">을 받으시기 바랍니다. (수강지도 미승인 학생은 수강신청 페이지 로그인 불가함)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 적용대상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 재학생에 한하여 실시</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(8.1~8.9 기간동안 복학신청학생도 수강지도상담 승인 대상자임)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">제외자 : 2012학년도 2학기 휴학자,&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffccff; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">8월10일 이후 복학자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012학년도 2학기 신(편)입생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 8월</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"> 1일부터 8월 9일까지 복학신청기간 동안 복학신청 학생은 수강지도상담 승인 대상자이며, 단 이번학기에 복학생에 한하여 수강지도상담 미승인자도 수강신청 페이지 로그인 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 수강지도상담 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 2012. 8. 1(수) 10:00 ~ 8. 10(금) 18:00까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">상담내역</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 14pt; TEXT-INDENT: -12pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;교</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">과목 이수체계도 및 졸업요건 등을 충분히 숙지하여 교육과정 이수에 문제가 발생하지 않도록 하며</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">, 부족한 학습 성과 항목을 체크하도록 함. </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 14pt; TEXT-INDENT: -12pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"665\" height=\"195\"><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3학년이상 재학생은</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 수강지도상담 및 수강신청시에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'\">『졸업가능여부 확인시스템』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">의 졸업가능여부 확인을 통하여 학생의 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">이수과목 내역</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 및 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">수강신청 필수과목</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 내역 확인 가능하니 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 학생 : 학생 본인내역 열람 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000033; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY강M'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">[원스톱서비스≫학사관리≫졸업≫졸업가능여부 확인자료 조회/출력</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/jsp/module/board/view01.do?conf_no=130&amp;board_no=59366&amp;group_no=-1&amp;up_geul_no=-1&amp;to_conf_no=&amp;delete_yn=0&amp;board_type=hm&amp;C_PAGE=1&amp;search_key=jemok&amp;keyword=%EC%A7%80%EB%8F%84%EA%B5%90%EC%88%98&amp;totalCnt=12&amp;paging=10\" target=\"_blank\"><em><strong>졸업가능여부 확인시스템 안내 공지 바로가기</strong></em></a></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 124.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -124.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 124.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -124.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 수강지도상담 방법</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 124.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -124.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;지도교수에게 온,오프라인으로 상담을 받은 후 웹상으로 수강승인을 받아야 함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">가. 지도교수 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 수강지도상담 조회 시 지도교수정보 열람 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞&nbsp;&nbsp; 학교메인홈페이지의 하단 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">교내주요사이트</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> → </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">공학인증관리시스템</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> →공학인증 → 상담 → 수강지도상담 클릭&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">나. 수강지도상담 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;상담 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff33cc; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">e-mail/ 전화/ 면담</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 등의 방법으로 지도교수와 상담</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 61.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -61.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 지도교수와&nbsp; 수강상담이 된 경우 수강승인 여부 확인 필요.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">상담방법 및 기타사항은 해당 학부(과)와 상의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;수강지도승인 확인(<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#000000\">공학인증관리시스템</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> →공학인증</span>상담→수강지도상담조회)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 수강</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">승인/</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">미</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">승인 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">이 된 경우 : 『승인여부』 화면에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">“승인”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">“미승인”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 표시 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 유의 사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 34.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -34.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">가. 수강지도 기간 중 지도교수와 상담을 하지 않아 수강승인을 받지 못한 학생은 수강신청기간에 수강신청을 할 수 없음.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 수강신청 페이지 로그인 불가</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수강지도기간에 수강승인을 받지 못한 학생은 학부 사무실로 문의.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ “6. 업무별 문의 전화번호 안내” 참고</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. 업무별 문의 전화번호 안내 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> </p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4p